{"type":"message","id":"70567a70","parentId":"dd16b4ce","timestamp":"2026-04-09T02:10:55.353Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"It's 10:10 AM Shanghai time. According to HEARTBEAT.md, this is the \"早盘扫描\" (morning scan) time at 08:00, and the next scheduled scan is 12:00 for \"午盘扫描\". However, since this is a heartbeat at 10:10 AM, I should perform the 08:00 scan task which was missed. Let me check what needs to be done.\n\nWait, looking at the schedule:\n- 08:00 - 早盘扫描 (morning scan - missed, 2+ hours ago)\n- 12:00 - 午盘扫描\n- 18:00 - 晚盘扫描\n\n\n- 22:00 - 夜盘扫描\n\nSince we're at 10:10 AM and the 08:00 scan was 2 hours ago, I should try to run that morning scan now, though it might be slightly outdated. Let me check if the required directories exist and then perform the scans that would have been done at 08:00, 12:00, 18:00, and 22:00.\n\nSince this is a heartbeat at 10:10 AM, I should focus on the morning scan duties—scanning market news, checking earnings calendars, and getting the fear and greed index—rather than waiting until the scheduled scan times.\n\nNow I need to check if the signals, reports, and paper-trading directories are set up, then execute the morning market scan.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_inozz8ke5hsi_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls /workspace/projects/workspace/signals/ 2>/dev/null && echo \"---\" && ls /workspace/projects/workspace/reports/daily/ 2>/dev/null && echo \"---\" && ls /workspace/projects/workspace/paper-trading/ 2>/dev/null"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"auto","usage":{"input":22179,"output":696,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22875,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775700642979}}
