{"type":"message","id":"a4b27862","parentId":"e64eeb86","timestamp":"2026-04-09T02:12:58.318Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Now let me send the morning report to Captain.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"早盘扫描完成 📊 **2026-04-09 早盘**\n\n---\n\n**🌅 隔夜/早盘关键事件**\n\n- 🇺🇸 **美股六连涨** — 纳指+2.8%，标普+2.51%，地缘风险骤降（美伊停火）\n- 🇨🇳 **A股昨日暴涨** — 沪指+2.70%报3995，创业板+5.91%；今日正常回调低开-0.69%\n- ₿ **加密货币反弹** — BTC突破$72,500，超12万人爆仓\n- 🛢️ **WTI原油暴跌-18.31%** — 停火后供给预期逆转\n\n---\n\n**📈 模拟账户**\n\n| 持仓 | 盈亏 | 止损 | 状态 |\n|------|------|------|------|\n| A50 多 (25手) | +1.3% | 95 | ✅ 正常盈利 |\n\n净值: $9,950.50 | 风险敞口: 25.56%\n\n---\n\n**🔔 今日信号**\n- A50 持仓继续持有，目标110，止损95\n- 4000点整数关口压力大，关注A股能否快速收复\n- 4月10日伊斯兰堡谈判——地缘关键节点\n\n报告已生成: `reports/daily/2026-04-09-morning.md`"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"auto","usage":{"input":502,"output":328,"cacheRead":34491,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":35321,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775700768315}}
